<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">"You Don't Get to Refuse": Huntrix, Singing Demon Boys, Entrapta, Bobby, the Best Friend Squad, and the Golden Honmoon</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;The Huntrix girls get closer to their new guests, enjoying their company as they hang out in Huntrix Tower, including eating meals together. Some time after, the girls see a demon boy band which threatens to take away their fans. Their arrival is the first part of a plan by Gwi-Ma to conquer the surface world. Entrapta's terrifying new weapon dispatches these demonic k-pop stars. After a fight in a men's bathhouse, they limp back to the underworld. As the girls prepare for the International Idol Awards, Entrapta constructs an anti-demon fence around the balcony of the penthouse apartment in Huntrix Tower, where the girls live. She later reveals something about how Rumi will be impacted when the Honmoon becomes golden, a revelation that shakes her to the core...&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
